# Project Planning Phase

## Project Title
**Pocket Smart AI: Your Smart Budget Recommendation Assistant**

---

## 1. Scope & Core Objectives
The **Project Planning Phase** outlines the project timeline, resource allocation, task breakdowns, risk management, and milestone tracking required to deliver **Pocket Smart AI** successfully within set parameters.

### Core Objectives
* **Timeline Efficiency:** Deliver a fully functional Minimum Viable Product (MVP) within a structured development cycle.
* **Agile Execution:** Implement two-week sprint cycles to iterate dynamically on user feedback and technical requirements.
* **Risk Mitigation:** Identify potential technical and compliance bottlenecks early to maintain system security and uptime.

---

## 2. Project Schedule & Phase Breakdown

| Phase | Estimated Duration | Primary Deliverables |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Phase 1: Planning & Requirements** | Week 1 - Week 2 | Scope definition, architecture setup, Requirement Analysis, Project Plan. |
| **Phase 2: System & UI Design** | Week 3 - Week 4 | Database schema, API architecture, high-fidelity UI/UX mockups. |
| **Phase 3: Core Development** | Week 5 - Week 8 | Backend API development, AI ML algorithm integration, Frontend build. |
| **Phase 4: Testing & QA** | Week 9 - Week 10 | Integration testing, AI model accuracy checks, security audits. |
| **Phase 5: Deployment & Demo** | Week 11 - Week 12 | Cloud deployment, project presentation, live demonstration, final docs. |

