## 4. Resource Allocation & Key Roles

* **Project Lead / Scrum Master:** Oversees sprint execution, milestone completion, and cross-team communication.
* **Frontend Developer:** Builds responsive React/Flutter interfaces, user dashboards, and dynamic data visualisations.
* **Backend Developer:** Constructs FastAPI backend endpoints, database ORMs, and secure data pipelines.
* **AI/ML Engineer:** Trains expense categorization models and optimizes prompt/scoring logic for financial insights.
* **QA & Security Specialist:** Conducts edge-case testing, performance benchmarking, and vulnerability checks.

---

## 5. Risk Assessment & Mitigation Strategy

| Identified Risk | Risk Level | Mitigation Strategy |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Inaccurate AI Categorization** | Medium | Implement standard fallback rule sets and allow manual user overrides to re-train local models. |
| **Data Privacy & Compliance Concerns** | High | Apply end-to-end encryption (AES-256) and strictly avoid storing sensitive bank credentials locally. |
| **Scope Creep** | Medium | Stick strictly to the MVP feature set during early sprints; defer complex integrations to post-launch iterations. |
| **API Latency Issues** | Low | Optimize database indexing and cache frequent AI insights via Redis or local server memory. |
